  "essentialEvidence": "Establish an applicable2026–2027 chair-specific pair of thesis-preparing RO3 courses for one coherent BBI pathway, reconciling the programme requirement to pass two RO3 courses for the chosen supervising chair with the module’s broader assumed-knowledge wording. The current programme fixes12restrictedcredits but the retrieved public sources do not identify the required pair per chair. Obtain current Biology thesis manual or authoritative chair applicability confirmation; do not import2014major rules or waive the two-course condition.",
  "officialAlternative": "Fresh official PEN education page accepts BBI research but links the older12-credit YBI85812 code, not a current chair-specific preparatory matrix for24-credit YBI86324. Current thesis module directs the manual to Biology programme information in Brightspace. Strong official searches locate2014–2015manual with old majors/12-credit thesis and unrelatedBBC guides; none establishes the current BBI pair. No university contact, account creation or enrolment.",
  "findings": [
    "Current2026handbook: compulsory105 + MathematicsA/B entrychoice3 + RO2six + RO3atleast12 + thesis24 =150 common;30free to180. No formal named major specified. First-listed MathematicsA option and first-listed Practical from Gene to Protein are illustrative neutral choices, not UCR-fit route selection. RO3twelve is retained as an uninstantiated restricted block; no complete pathway claimed.",
    "Corrected actual module weights: bio-organic3 (was6), EcologyI3 (was6), EcologyII3 (was6), CellBiology6 (was3), Structure/FunctionPlants6 (was3), Evolution/Systematics6 (was3), Physics3 (was6), PlantReproduction3 (was6), Ethics3 (was6), Development3 (was6), AnimalBehaviour3 (was6), Invertebrates/Algae/Fungi9 (was6). Dedicated RO3twelve added; open30 remains genuinely open. Current titles use official English names.",
    "Programme thesis cluster requires102 prescribed credits including all60 first-year and passing two chair-preparing RO3 courses. YBI86324 mandatory knowledge repeats102/allB1; assumed knowledge names common study, AdvancedStatistics or EcologicalMethods and at leastone specialising RO2/RO3 course for2024onward. That broader assumption does not waive the programme two-RO3 rule or remove compulsory AdvancedStatistics. No exact current supervising-chair pair is established.",
    "Thesis24 is original laboratory, field or modelling research generating new data; research plan, article, presentation and defence. Timely formal intake/registration at leastone month before starting is mandatory; discuss projects aboutfour months ahead. General/laboratory/fieldwork safety and BiologySkillsPortfolio0EC remain separate requirements.",
    "Current public overview corroborates cell-to-ecosystem identity, biology/chemistry/physics/quantitative foundations, laboratory/field investigation, biological modelling, health/nature applications and four-month research. It explicitly distinguishes biology from medicine and societal forestry. Example projects, personal bird/mammal interests, employers and later-study outcomes are search-only, not programme generators."
  ]
}
